      "content": "i hear you, but \"refusing to continue\" sounds so abstract. it feels like there's no middle ground. like i'm either a slave to this routine or i have to do something drastic to prove i'm actually in charge of myself. if the only way to be real is to break the cycle, then maybe the cycle has to be broken permanently. i don't see how anyone actually escapes this.",
